       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. PREDICATES.
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01 COUNT-A PIC 9 VALUE 1.
       01 AMOUNT-A PIC 9V99 VALUE 1.25.
       01 NAME-A PIC X(8) VALUE 'MATCH'.
       01 FLAG-A PIC X VALUE 'Y'.
       88 ACTIVE-A VALUE 'Y'.
       01 TARGET-A PIC X(8).
       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
       IF COUNT-A > 3 AND ACTIVE-A
           CONTINUE
       END-IF.
       IF AMOUNT-A >= 1.25 OR NAME-A NOT = 'ABC'
           CONTINUE
       END-IF.
       EVALUATE TRUE
       WHEN COUNT-A > 3 AND ACTIVE-A
           CONTINUE
       WHEN OTHER
           CONTINUE
       END-EVALUATE.
       EVALUATE NAME-A
       WHEN 'MATCH'
           MOVE 'WINNER' TO TARGET-A
       WHEN 'MATCH'
           MOVE 'LATER' TO TARGET-A
       WHEN OTHER
           MOVE 'OTHER' TO TARGET-A
       END-EVALUATE.
       CALL TARGET-A.
       PERFORM UNTIL COUNT-A > 3 AND ACTIVE-A
           CONTINUE
       END-PERFORM.
       GOBACK.
